# Proprietary graphical-world art (licensed asset packs — not redistributable).
# World logic/scaffolding stays public; only the pixels are gated. See
# src/assets/world/README.md. Official app builds bake these in; forks run
# without the world (detector disables it) or supply their own art here.
src/assets/world/*
!src/assets/world/README.md

